--- Single entry point for the whole P3109/D1 Maude specification.
---
---   maude load-spec.maude
---
--- Loads in dependency order the exact rational core from load-core.maude,
--- the symbolic real profile from load-symbolic.maude, and the external-format
--- and real-number contracts from load-contracts.maude, then defines one top
--- module P3109-SPEC that imports every executable module.
---
--- The contract theories P3109-REAL-CONTRACT and P3109-EXTERNAL-FORMAT and the
--- parameterized bridge P3109-EXTERNAL-BRIDGE are loaded into the module
--- database but are theories or parameterized, so a functional module cannot
--- import them. Instantiate the bridge with a view once an external-format
--- implementation exists.
---
--- sload rather than load: the three loaders each pull load-core.maude, and
--- sload skips a file that has already been loaded, so nothing is redefined.

sload load-core.maude
sload load-symbolic.maude
sload load-contracts.maude

fmod P3109-SPEC is
  including P3109-SYMBOLIC .
endfm
